344440,PMP-80093,idp,Cover only for Protekt™ Aire 9000 BL,Cover only for Protekt™ Aire 9000 BL,0,0,0,,"* 1300 LPM (liters per minute) true low air loss.<br /> <EOL>* Dual therapies of low air loss and alternating pressure combined in one pump.<br /> <EOL>* 10 pressure level settings help customize to each individual patient requirements.<br /> <EOL>* Digital cycle time display range from 5-95 minutes.<br /> <EOL>* Auto firm for quick 1 minute mattress inflation.<br /> <EOL>* Cell-on-cell air bladder system prevents the patient from bottoming out in case of a power failure.<br /> <EOL>* Quilted nylon waterproof top cover provides additional patient comfort.<br /> <EOL>* Lock out feature prevents disruption of clinicians pump settings.<br /> <EOL>* Static function suspends alternating mode to provide firm support for safe egress and ingress from bed.<br /> <EOL>* Audio and visual power failure alarms.<br /> <EOL>* Weight capacity: 1, 000 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* Mattress dimensions: 36""x80""x10"".<br /> <EOL>* UL/CSA approved power cord.<br /> <EOL>* 18 month warranty.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,80,36,10,1000,Y,58283,Proactive Medical/Air Mattress Systems,,120.010,,Monday 17 August 2015 07:45:48 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,95,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
