344711,PMP-30600-PLE,idp,"Electric Full Body Lift, 600Lb","Electric Full Body Lift, 600Lb",0,0,0,,"* Designed to provide the perfect combination of patient safety, weight capacity and maneuverability.<br /> <EOL>* This lift is manufactured to meet the special needs of the bariatric patient population in hospitals and nursing homes.<br /> <EOL>* Caregivers appreciate the ease of operation and patients are reassured by the stability and overall comfort provided.<br /> <EOL>* Bariatric lift with extra large lift frame provides outstanding integration with large patients.<br /> <EOL>* 600lb capacity with manual emergency lowering.<br /> <EOL>* 6 sling hooks allow for multiple sling options and a wider range of transfers.<br /> <EOL>* Battery lasts twice as long as competing options for less downtime (24 volt).<br /> <EOL>* Ergonomically designed foot pedal base opening (nu clumsy hand lever).<br /> <EOL>* Clip free sling hookups improve safety and reduce downtime.<br /> <EOL>* Full parts breakdowns and modular design on lift and electronics.<br /> <EOL>* Advanced electronics with auxiliary up/down lift controls.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,58376,Proactive Medical/Beveled floor Mat,,1846.150,,Wednesday 26 August 2015 04:28:42 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,1499,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
