344741,PMP-20110,idp,Finger Pulse Oximeter,Finger Pulse Oximeter,0,0,26,,"* Accurate reading of SpO2 values is among the most important factors for successful management of respiratory care.<br /> <EOL>* For patients with a breathing disorder, monitoring blood-oxygen levels can save their lives.<br /> <EOL>* Fingertip pulse oximeters offer a non-invasive, safe way to do this.<br /> <EOL>* These models are also well suited for exercise, sport purposes, and high-altitude activities.<br /> <EOL>* With the Proactive fingertip oximeter, you can always monitor the oxygen saturation and heart rate values reported by your patients.<br /> <EOL>* With over 20 years of manufacturing, engineering and research experience, and we have a long-standing reputation for excellence.<br /> <EOL>* Ideal for use in multiple applications; hospital, nursing home, community medical treatment, home care, sports center, etc.<br /> <EOL>* Portable non-invasive spot check oxygen saturation and heart rate.<br /> <EOL>* Two AAA batteries can be continuously operated for more than 30 hours.<br /> <EOL>* Displays digital SpO2 and pulse rate while using bar graph technology to monitor heart rate.<br /> <EOL>* Conserves power by shutting off automatically when no signal is detected, preserving the battery life.<br /> <EOL>* Measures: 2.6”L x 1.4”W x 1.3” H.<br /> <EOL>* Weighs: 2.1 oz with batteries.<br /> <EOL>* 1 Year limited warranty<br /> <EOL>* Display mode LCD display<br /> <EOL>* SpO2 Range 70% to 100%<br /> <EOL>* Pulse Rate (PR) Range 30 to 240 bpm<br /> <EOL>* SpO2 Resolution 1%<br /> <EOL>* Pulse Rate (PR) Resolution 1 bpm<br /> <EOL>* SpO2 Accuracy +/- 2% at 70 to 100%<br /> <EOL>* Unspecified for < 70%<br /> <EOL>* Pulse Rate (PR) Accuracy +/- 2% or +/- 2 bpm<br /> <EOL>* From 30 – 250 bpm",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,58394,Proactive Medical/Pulse Oximetry,,26.050,,Wednesday 26 August 2015 08:25:57 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,19.950,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
