344435,PMP-80089,idp,Individual Bladder for Protekt Aire 8000BA-48,Individual Bladder for Protekt Aire 8000BA-48,0,0,0,,"Alternating pressure cycles of 10,15,20 & 25 allows clinicians to customize pressure redistribution and skin surface interface. <EOL>Low air loss function controls and manages moisture to prevent skin maceration. <EOL>Cell-on-cell mattress design prevents patient from bottoming out in case of power failure. <EOL>10"" air cells are constructed of Nylon/PU for added comfort and support. <EOL>Audible low pressure alarms alerts clinicians when preset pressure levels decrease. <EOL>Static mode allows for easy transfer in and out of bed. <EOL>Pillow top feature prevents head and neck from unnecessary movement during alternating mode. <EOL>CPR pull tab quickly release air from mattress. <EOL>2 year warranty. <EOL>Weight: 9 lbs <EOL> ",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,58283,Proactive Medical/Air Mattress Systems,,45.330,,Monday 17 August 2015 07:18:16 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,35,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
344439,PMP-80094,idp,Individual Bladder for Protekt Aire 9000BL,Individual Bladder for Protekt Aire 9000BL,0,0,0,,"* 1300 LPM (liters per minute) true low air loss.<br /> <EOL>* Dual therapies of low air loss and alternating pressure combined in one pump.<br /> <EOL>* 10 pressure level settings help customize to each individual patient requirements.<br /> <EOL>* Digital cycle time display range from 5-95 minutes.<br /> <EOL>* Auto firm for quick 1 minute mattress inflation.<br /> <EOL>* Cell-on-cell air bladder system prevents the patient from bottoming out in case of a power failure.<br /> <EOL>* Quilted nylon waterproof top cover provides additional patient comfort.<br /> <EOL>* Lock out feature prevents disruption of clinicians pump settings.<br /> <EOL>* Static function suspends alternating mode to provide firm support for safe egress and ingress from bed.<br /> <EOL>* Audio and visual power failure alarms.<br /> <EOL>* Weight capacity: 1, 000 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* Mattress dimensions: 36""x80""x10"".<br /> <EOL>* UL/CSA approved power cord.<br /> <EOL>* 18 month warranty.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,58283,Proactive Medical/Air Mattress Systems,,45.330,,Monday 17 August 2015 07:40:58 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,35,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
343540,PMP-80024,idp,Individual Bladder for Protekt™ Aire 2000,Individual Bladder for Protekt™ Aire 2000,0,0,0,,The Protekt™ Aire 2000 incorporates a system of 17 individual bladders. The pump offers a 10 minute cycle time; adjustable air flow settings to meet individual patient's needs.,,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,58283,Proactive Medical/Air Mattress Systems,,19.910,,Thursday 13 August 2015 08:05:31 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,0,,15,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
