343589,PMP-80062,idp,Mattress only for Protekt™ Aire 6000,Mattress only for Protekt™ Aire 6000,0,0,300,,* Mattress & Cover<br /> <EOL>* Unique cell-on-cell design ensures that the mattress will hold air in the lower cells in the event of a power failure.<br /> <EOL>* Transport connector locks in air for easy patient transport.<br /> <EOL>* Quilted top cover provides comfortable sleeping surface.<br /> <EOL>* Bottom cover has 3 non-skid rubber panels to prevent mattress from slipping.,,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,8,80,36,1000,Y,58283,Proactive Medical/Air Mattress Systems,,213.710,,Friday 14 August 2015 06:31:01 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,0,,180,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
343599,PMP-80072,idp,Mattress only for Protekt™ Aire 7000,Mattress only for Protekt™ Aire 7000,0,0,1350,,The Protekt™ Aire 7000 combines lateral rotation and "true" low air loss in one mattress system.,,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,8,80,36,1000,Y,58283,Proactive Medical/Air Mattress Systems,,830.210,,Friday 14 August 2015 08:21:06 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,0,,700,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
344428,PMP-80082,idp,Mattress only for Protekt™ Aire 8000BA-42,Mattress only for Protekt™ Aire 8000BA-42,0,0,575,,"Alternating pressure cycles of 10,15,20 & 25 allows clinicians to customize pressure redistribution and skin surface interface. <EOL>Low air loss function controls and manages moisture to prevent skin maceration. <EOL>Cell-on-cell mattress design prevents patient from bottoming out in case of power failure. <EOL>10"" air cells are constructed of Nylon/PU for added comfort and support. <EOL>Audible low pressure alarms alerts clinicians when preset pressure levels decrease. <EOL>Static mode allows for easy transfer in and out of bed. <EOL>Pillow top feature prevents head and neck from unnecessary movement during alternating mode. <EOL>CPR pull tab quickly release air from mattress. <EOL>2 year warranty. <EOL>Weight: 9 lbs",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,8,80,42,1000,Y,58283,Proactive Medical/Air Mattress Systems,,444.900,,Monday 17 August 2015 04:55:30 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,375,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
343536,PMP-80022,idp,Mattress overlay only for Protekt™ Aire 2000,Mattress overlay only for Protekt™ Aire 2000,0,0,125,,"Mattress & Cover <EOL> <EOL>16 laser air holes to keep patient cool and dry <EOL>Removable water resistant, non-shear, anti-microbial nylon cover, non-skid bottom cover prevents slipping. <EOL>CPR valve provides rapid deflation of mattress <EOL>Dimensions: 35""x80""x5"" <EOL>Weight: 9 lbs <EOL>Alternating cell depth: 5"" <EOL> ",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,80,36,5,1000,Y,58283,Proactive Medical/Air Mattress Systems,,89.230,,Thursday 13 August 2015 07:48:55 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,0,,75,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
344720,PMP-30114,idp,Mesh Sling - Full Body with Commode,Mesh Sling - Full Body with Commode,0,0,0,,"Proactive offers a complete line of slings to meet the dynamic needs in both the long-term care and homecare settings. These slings are an industry standard, and deliver the ease of use, comfort and security that is standard in all Proactive products. <EOL>  <EOL> <EOL>FEATURES <EOL> <EOL>Sling size and fit can vary significantly depending on patient weight and girth. These are general guidelines. Consult physician before sling selection <EOL>Washing instructions are on each sling label. Washing temperatures should not exceed 180° F. Air-dry or dry at low temperatures. <EOL>All slings are constructed of polyester fabrics which can be used in wet or dry environments",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,58389,Proactive Medical/Full Body Slings,,45.330,,Wednesday 26 August 2015 06:08:09 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,35,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
344715,PMP-32450,idp,Move - Standing Transfer,Move - Standing Transfer,0,0,0,,* This Protekt&trade; Move is your best choice for fall prevention and is also a vital part of reducing lifting injuries while at the same time promoting mobility for the patient.<br /> <EOL>* Offers ample weight capacity at 450 lbs.<br /> <EOL>* Includes an adjustable base to provide clearence around common obstacles such as recliners allowing access to patients.<br /> <EOL>* 450 lb.<br /> <EOL>* Capacity.<br /> <EOL>* Dual Shin Pads for extra support.<br /> <EOL>* Support strap available - attachment hooks for optional side support and back strap.<br /> <EOL>* Simple solution to compliment your electric stand assist lifters.<br /> <EOL>* First choice for any fall prevention program.,,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,58376,Proactive Medical/Beveled floor Mat,,923.690,,Wednesday 26 August 2015 05:14:33 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,750,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
344751,PMP-40010,idp,Non-Contact Infrared Thermometer,Non-Contact Infrared Thermometer,0,0,0,,"* The Protemp non-contact infrared thermometer has been developed using the latest infrared technology, allowing the temporal artery (TA) temperature to be taken without touching the patient, at a distance of 2 inches away from the forehead.<br /> <EOL>* Precise, instantaneous, and without contact, the ProTemp is the most suitable thermometer for no risk temperature measurement in a long term facility setting.<br /> <EOL>* Studies have demonstrated that this method of TA temperature measurement is more precise than tympanic thermometry, and better tolerated than rectal thermometry.<br /> <EOL>* FUNCTIONS: <br /> <EOL>* Designed to take the body temperature of a person without the interference from the heat of the surrounding environment.<br /> <EOL>* Reliable and stable infrared detection system.<br /> <EOL>* Audio alarm when the temperature is too high.<br /> <EOL>* Memory for 32 previous measurements.<br /> <EOL>* Back-lit LCD screen.<br /> <EOL>* Data can be displayed in either Celsius or Fahrenheit.<br /> <EOL>* Automatic shut off (energy saving device).<br /> <EOL>* Practical, easy to use.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,58400,Proactive Medical/Thermometry,,58.270,,Thursday 27 August 2015 04:26:34 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,45,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
344453,PMP-81012,idp,Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress,Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress,0,0,159,,* Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress<br /> <EOL>* Medicare code EO184<br /> <EOL>* The Protekt&trade; 100 pressure redistribution foam mattress is specifically designed for the value oriented facilities with limited budgets.<br /> <EOL>* The three (3) zones are comprised of 670 individual cells that are independent from one another.<br /> <EOL>* This design enables the mattress to conform to the patient's body and customize support as the patient moves.<br /> <EOL>* Excellent pressure redistribution is achieved by varying cell depths throughout the mattress.<br /> <EOL>* Special attention is given to the vulnerable heel section to decrease interface pressure.,,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,80,6,36,1000,Y,58284,Proactive Medical/Foam Matresses,,112.940,,Tuesday 18 August 2015 04:57:36 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,95,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
344454,PMP-81013,idp,Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress,Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress,0,0,179,,Medicare code EO184 <EOL> <EOL>The Protekt™ 100 pressure redistribution foam mattress is specifically designed for the value oriented facilities with limited budgets. The three (3) zones are comprised of 670 individual cells that are independent from one another. This design enables the mattress to conform to the patient's body and customize support as the patient moves. Excellent pressure redistribution is achieved by varying cell depths throughout the mattress. Special attention is given to the vulnerable heel section to decrease interface pressure. <EOL> <EOL> ,,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,84,6,36,1000,Y,58284,Proactive Medical/Foam Matresses,,124.790,,Tuesday 18 August 2015 05:09:49 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,105,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
344459,PMP-81022,idp,Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress,Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress,0,0,189,,The Protekt™ 200 is an economical multi-tiered pressure redistribution mattress. This mattress is ideal for moderate to high risk patients.,,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,80,6,36,1000,Y,58284,Proactive Medical/Foam Matresses,,142.580,,Tuesday 18 August 2015 06:08:13 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,120,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
344464,PMP-81031,idp,Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress,Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress,0,0,209,,The Protekt™ 300 provides exceptional pressure redistribution. This mattress is ideal for moderate to high risk patients with close attention paid to the vulnerable sacral and heel area by utilizing ultra high density foam.,,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,76,6,36,1000,Y,58284,Proactive Medical/Foam Matresses,,154.430,,Tuesday 18 August 2015 06:50:13 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,130,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
344503,PMP-81042,idp,Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress,Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress,0,0,249.990,,The Protekt™ 400 is a perfect choice for your high risk patients. The top layer of foam is Lura-Quilt™which is a patented aerated open cell foam that allows air to continuously circulate under the patient to keep them cool and dry.,,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,80,6,36,1000,Y,58284,Proactive Medical/Foam Matresses,,184.070,,Wednesday 19 August 2015 04:22:47 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,155,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
344504,PMP-81043,idp,Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress,Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress,0,0,249.990,,The Protekt™ 400 is a perfect choice for your high risk patients. The top layer of foam is Lura-Quilt™which is a patented aerated open cell foam that allows air to continuously circulate under the patient to keep them cool and dry.,,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,84,6,36,1000,Y,58284,Proactive Medical/Foam Matresses,,195.930,,Wednesday 19 August 2015 04:25:18 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,165,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
344510,PMP-81053,idp,Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress,Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress,0,0,279.990,,"* The Protekt&trade; 500 with (VGPT)&trade; Visco Gel Polymer Technology is a revolutionary support surface that provides unprecedented pressure redistribution, rapid heat dissipation, and vast increases in breathability compared to traditional foam.<br /> <EOL>* Heel slope redistributes pressure from heel to the entire leg.<br /> <EOL>* Precision cut air pockets allows deeper submersion and increased air circulation.<br /> <EOL>* Gel infused foam.<br /> <EOL>* VGPT&trade; is open-cell Visco Memory foam infused with gel Polymers.<br /> <EOL>* Designed for clinical superiority as well as patient comfort, some of the many benefits of VGPT&trade; include: <br /> <EOL>* Reduced occurrence of pressure sores by channeling heat away from the body significantly faster than traditional foam, virtually eliminating perspiration.<br /> <EOL>* Superior pressure redistribution is delivered by providing more support and less cradling at higher levels of compression, redistributing pressure over a large surface area eliminating static fatigue.<br /> <EOL>* Protects vulnerable heel area with the patented Lure-Quilt&trade; foam and a 30 degree slope redistributing pressure to the entire leg and away from the heel.<br /> <EOL>* 15 Year Non-Prorated Warranty<br /> <EOL>* (VGPT)&trade; Visco Gel Polymer Technology works by allowing air to pass through open cells, channeling it away from the body instead of trapping it within the closed cells of standard memory foam.<br /> <EOL>* The infusion of gel polymers throughout the foam contributes both cooling properties and the virtual elimination of static fatigue.<br /> <EOL>* As a result of the alliance between open cell foam and gel infusion, the Protekt&trade; 500 holds its shape better, redistributes pressure over a larger surface area, and successfully channels heat away from the body, keeping patients cool, dry, and comfortable.<br /> <EOL>* The heel section of the Protekt&trade; 500 provides unparalleled pressure mapping results.<br /> <EOL>* Designed to guard the vulnerable heel area from incapacitating reoccurring pressure ulcers, the heel section of the Protekt&trade; 500 utilizes a 30 degree slope to redistribute pressure to the entire lower leg, the top layer is finished with Lura-Quilt&trade;, a patented, highly resilient aerated foam, keeping skin cool and dry.<br /> <EOL>* Optional Raised side rails reduce risk of falls and increase patient safety by providing a firm perimeter for egress and ingress.<br /> <EOL>* Rails are 3 inches high with a 24 inch cutout.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,84,6,36,1000,Y,58284,Proactive Medical/Foam Matresses,,207.780,,Wednesday 19 August 2015 06:07:25 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,175,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
344456,PMP-81015,idp,Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress w/ 3" Raised Rails,Pressure Redistribution Foam Mattress w/ 3" Raised Rails,0,0,179,,* The Protekt&trade; 100 pressure redistribution foam mattress is specifically designed for the value oriented facilities with limited budgets.<br /> <EOL>* The three (3) zones are comprised of 670 individual cells that are independent from one another.<br /> <EOL>* This design enables the mattress to conform to the patient's body and customize support as the patient moves.<br /> <EOL>* Excellent pressure redistribution is achieved by varying cell depths throughout the mattress.<br /> <EOL>* Special attention is given to the vulnerable heel section to decrease interface pressure.,,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,9,80,36,1000,Y,58284,Proactive Medical/Foam Matresses,,130.720,,Tuesday 18 August 2015 05:42:57 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,110,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
