344745,PMP-60110,idp,Reusable Finger Probe-Welch Allyn Spot,Reusable Finger Probe-Welch Allyn Spot,0,0,22,,"* Ong periods of pressure over bony prominences put a patient at an increased risk for the development of pressure ulcers.<br /> <EOL>* The heel is one of the most prone areas to this problem.<br /> <EOL>* Elderly individuals, those who are neurologically impaired, and the acutely hospitalized patients are generally of great concern for this condition.<br /> <EOL>* The foot pillows provide comfort and general protection from ulcers for those patients prone to this condition.<br /> <EOL>* By reducing pressure, blood flow is increased to the heel region, preventing ulcers from developing.<br /> <EOL>* Extra-thick polyfoam reduces pressure and cushions sensitive heels.<br /> <EOL>* Covered with soft terry cloth reduces skin shear.<br /> <EOL>* Oversized heel protectors are designed to stay in place, even on restless residents.<br /> <EOL>* Secure velcro closure makes securing and removal quick and easy.<br /> <EOL>* Machine washable.<br /> <EOL>* Meets CA #117.",,1000000,0,Y,0.010,N,Y,1,0,0,0,1000,Y,58398,Proactive Medical/Foot Therapy/Positioning Products,,14.540,,Thursday 27 August 2015 04:09:04 AM,0,0,0.600,"2,3,4,6,8,12",0,3280,,12,42,N,236,Proactive Medical Products
